// TEST: Atan2 Unit Mismatch (rejects)
// ERROR: BL3006
// atan2(y, x) accepts dimensioned operands only when they share ONE signature
// (units/066): the intrinsic sees the ratio y/x, and meters/seconds is not a
// number. BL3006 is the unit-algebra band, the same code the `+` mismatch
// reports. The accepting direction, and the same-dimension-different-magnitude
// rejection, are units/066 and unit-errors/009.
Unit meters
Unit seconds
let dy: Float<meters> = 1.0
let dt: Float<seconds> = 1.0
let bad = atan2(dy, dt)
